  {%- comment -%} BRAND INTRO {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="ky-section" id="ky-intro">
    <div class="ky-container">
      <div class="ky-section-header ky-left-align" style="margin-bottom:40px">
        <span class="ky-eyebrow">The KOYO Brand</span>
        <h2 class="ky-accent-heading">Comfort With Purpose.<br>Built in Japan.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="ky-intro-lead">In a market full of massage chairs that compete on spec sheets, button counts, and aggressive feature lists, <strong>KOYO takes a different approach</strong>. The brand was built on a deceptively simple premise: <em>a premium massage chair should feel genuinely good every single time you sit in it</em> — not just on the first demo, not just on the highest setting, but consistently, day after day.</p>
      <p class="ky-intro-lead" style="margin-top:0">That philosophy runs through everything KOYO makes — from the choice of materials to the engineering of the massage mechanism to the simplicity of the controls. It is not about performance theater. It is about <strong>real, human-feel comfort, built to a Japanese standard of quality</strong>, and designed to become a trusted part of your home wellness routine for years.</p>
      <div class="ky-intro-pillars">
        <div class="ky-intro-pillar"><h3>Comfort First</h3><p>Every engineering decision in a KOYO chair is made in service of the massage feeling better — not looking more impressive on a spec list. The 303TS delivers warmth, presence, and genuine therapeutic feel before anything else.</p></div>
        <div class="ky-intro-pillar"><h3>Made in Japan</h3><p>KOYO massage chairs are manufactured in Japan, where build quality, material consistency, and long-term reliability are non-negotiables. This is not a marketing claim — it is a standard that shapes every element of how the chair performs over years of daily use.</p></div>
        <div class="ky-intro-pillar"><h3>Approachable Premium</h3><p>KOYO is not luxury for luxury's sake. It is refined premium ownership for buyers who want the real thing — a chair that performs beautifully, looks considered in any room, and stays intuitive from the first session to the thousandth.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

