  {%- comment -%} JAPAN HERITAGE {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="ky-japan-banner" id="ky-japan">
    <div class="ky-container">
      <div class="ky-japan-inner">
        <div>
          <div class="ky-japan-eyebrow">Made in Japan</div>
          <h2>Why Japanese Manufacturing Changes Everything</h2>
          <p>There is a reason buyers specifically search for massage chairs made in Japan. It is not nostalgia — it is a measurable expectation of quality. Japan's manufacturing culture is built around precision, consistency, and long-term integrity rather than short-term cost efficiency.</p>
          <p>In practice, this means KOYO massage chairs are designed and built to perform the same way on day 1,000 as they do on day 1. The brushless motor runs with minimal friction and noise. The silicone massage heads are formulated to maintain their feel over years of use. The chassis and upholstery are assembled to tolerances that translate into longevity you can feel rather than just claim.</p>
          <p>When you compare a KOYO chair to a commodity massage chair, the difference is quiet confidence — the kind of quality you only truly appreciate once you have lived with it.</p>
          <ul class="ky-japan-points">
            <li>Precision engineering culture prioritizes long-term reliability over short-term cost</li>
            <li>Brushless motor technology delivers quieter, smoother, longer-lasting performance</li>
            <li>Anthropoid silicone heads engineered to retain feel and response over years of sessions</li>
            <li>Tight build tolerances translate into a chair that sounds, moves, and feels premium daily</li>
            <li>Subject to Japanese quality assurance standards before leaving the factory</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="ky-japan-stats">
          <div class="ky-japan-stat"><span class="ky-japan-stat-num">Made<br>in Japan</span><span class="ky-japan-stat-label">Manufactured to Japanese quality standards</span></div>
          <div class="ky-japan-stat"><span class="ky-japan-stat-num">Servo<br>4D</span><span class="ky-japan-stat-label">Human-feel massage mechanism</span></div>
