  {%- comment -%} WHY KOYO FEELS DIFFERENT {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="ky-section ky-section-alt" id="ky-why">
    <div class="ky-container">
      <div class="ky-section-header">
        <span class="ky-eyebrow">Why KOYO</span>
        <h2 class="ky-accent-heading">The Quiet Confidence of a Chair Built for Real Life</h2>
        <p>KOYO is not positioned as a lifestyle statement or a show of technological complexity. It is built for people who have done their research, know what they want, and are ready to live with a chair that rewards their decision every day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ky-pillar-grid">
        <div class="ky-pillar-card"><div class="ky-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L20 8l-9 9z"/></svg></div><h3>Human-Feel Massage That Earns Trust</h3><p>The Servo 4D mechanism with anthropoid silicone massage heads moves with deliberate, organic variation — closer to a therapist's hands than any standard roller system. Buyers describe sessions as "lifelike" precisely because the engineering prioritized feel over spec numbers.</p></div>
        <div class="ky-pillar-card"><div class="ky-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 3H5c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm-7 14l-5-5 1.41-1.41L12 14.17l7.59-7.59L21 10l-9 9z"/></svg></div><h3>Simple Enough for Real Daily Use</h3><p>Complexity is the enemy of daily use. KOYO's touchscreen remote and fingertip control dial let you begin a session in seconds — you sit down, select what you need, and the chair does the rest without navigating an overwhelming menu system.</p></div>
        <div class="ky-pillar-card"><div class="ky-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4z"/></svg></div><h3>A Chair That Stays with Your Home</h3><p>KOYO 303TS is available in Black, Pearl, and Walnut — genuine finish differences that allow the chair to integrate with modern, bright, or warm interior styles. This is a chair designed to belong in a room, not compete with it.</p></div>
        <div class="ky-pillar-card"><div class="ky-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 12h-5v5h5v-5zM16 1v2H8V1H6v2H5c-1.11 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L3 19c0 1.1.89 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2h-1V1h-2zm3 18H5V8h14v11z"/></svg></div><h3>Full Body. Every Session.</h3><p>From neck to feet, the 303TS covers the full body with no significant gaps. The hybrid SL-Track follows your natural spine through to the thighs. Full-body air compression wraps arms, shoulders, legs, and seat. Foot rollers engage the soles. Heat warms the calves and low back.</p></div>
        <div class="ky-pillar-card"><div class="ky-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2h-4c0 1.1.9 2 2 2zm6-6v-5c0-3.07-1.64-5.64-4.5-6.32V4c0-.83-.67-1.5-1.5-1.5s-1.5.67-1.5 1.5v.68C7.63 5.36 6 7.92 6 11v5l-2 2v1h16v-1l-2-2z"/></svg></div><h3>Personalized from Seat One</h3><p>Auto body scan technology reads your spine position and dimensions at the start of every session, adjusting the roller path to match your body before any program begins. Your massage is personalized to you — not a generic template adjusted slightly for your height.</p></div>
        <div class="ky-pillar-card"><div class="ky-pillar-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v10.55c-.59-.34-1.27-.55-2-.55-2.21 0-4 1.79-4 4s1.79 4 4 4 4-1.79 4-4V7h4V3h-6z"/></svg></div><h3>Calm Ownership. Quiet Operation.</h3><p>The brushless motor technology powers the KOYO 303TS with significantly less noise, less vibration, and significantly longer expected service life. The result is a chair that feels premium in all the right ways — including just sitting in a room with it running.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
